			<item>
				<title>Squirrel</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/cpp_notes/posts/autoupdate/squirrel/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 18 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/cpp_notes/posts/autoupdate/squirrel/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;介绍&#34;&gt;介绍&lt;a href=&#34;#%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://github.com/Squirrel/Squirrel.Windows&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;Squirrel&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt; 是比 Omaha 更轻量化的自动更新框架，基于 &lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://learn.microsoft.com/zh-cn/nuget/what-is-nuget&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;NuGet&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt; 包管理器，通过一系列的工具和动态库实现 Windows 应用程序的安装和更新。目前 &lt;code&gt;Electron&lt;/code&gt; 使用 Squirrel 管理软件更新。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
